###
# Digital Clinic Authentication API Tests
# Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code
# Or copy the requests to Postman/Insomnia
###

### Variables
@baseURL = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

# Save the token from login/register response and paste it here
@authToken = your_token_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseURL}}

### API Info
GET {{baseURL}}/api

###
### ============================================
### REGISTRATION TESTS
### ============================================
###

### 1. Register Patient User
POST {{baseURL}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "role": "patient"
}

