###
### ============================================
### PROTECTED ENDPOINT TESTS (NEW)
### ============================================
###

### 7. Get Current User Profile (With Valid Token)
# First: Login above and copy the token to @authToken variable
GET {{baseURL}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
### 8. Get Current User - No Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/auth/me

###
### 9. Get Current User - Invalid Token Format (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: InvalidFormat

###
### 10. Get Current User - Invalid Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

###
### 11. Get Current User - Empty Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseURL}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer 

